AMENDEDANALYSIS
This bill allows certain articles of clothing supporting a candidate or measure to be worn by a
voter in the process of casting his or her vote. This bill also allows the use of electronic poll book
devicesintownmeetings,specialmeetings,anddeliberativesessions.
